OL,3,ABehaviour guidelines for life in UK
OL,4,Apublished for asylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew behavioural guidance for asylum
OL,7,Fseekers has been published by the Home
OL,8,FOffice.
OL,10,FA nine-page booklet covering issues
OL,11,Fincluding respect in public, sex and
OL,12,Fconsent, and gender equality, has gone
OL,13,Fonline, with guidance on how laws and
OL,14,Fcustoms in the UK may be different from
OL,15,Fthe home country of asylum seekers.
OL,17,FThe Conservatives' shadow home
OL,18,Fsecretary Chris Philp said: "Instead of
OL,19,Ftrying to train these mainly young,
OL,20,Fmale illegal immigrants behave in a
OL,21,Fcivilised way towards women, they
OL,22,Fshould be deported."
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
