OL,3,ABehaviour guidelines for life in UK
OL,4,Apublished for asylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd Reform UK's home affairs spokesman
OL,7,FZia Yusuf labelled the document "a
OL,8,Fdisgrace", adding its publication
OL,9,Fshowed the government "know that they
OL,10,Fare a menace".
